    <p>
      <b>Algorithms</b>
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>INIT clears xSeries and ySeries.</li>
      <li>AFTER_STEP appends input 1 to xSeries and input 2 to ySeries; missing inputs append NaN.</li>
      <li>The block has no outputs.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      <b>Extended Capabilities</b>
    </p>
